TITLE 1D transport (10 cells, 10 shifts) with exchange; HCl molality in cell 4 at shift 10
SOLUTION 0  Inflow
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10  Initial in all cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivity 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_cells 4
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities HCl
END
